{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-199444-r4505122","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Maple-Glazed BBQ Ribs","sourcePageId":199444,"sourceRevision":"4505122","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-10T01:10:41Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Maple-Glazed%20BBQ%20Ribs&oldid=4505122","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:08:24.620Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Barbecue recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar","Category:Recipes using maple syrup","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"2f160869d875fa4fe1a1cb4688ce111af437e44ed3048bd7a4ac249e50a927a1","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Pork recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\nMaple syrup and pork just sort of seem to be made for each other.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 1 slab [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]] spareribs\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 3 Tbsp dark [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 2 Tbsp smoked [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 2 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Maple Syrup|maple syrup]]\n* 1 cup white [[Cookbook:Wine|wine]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 3 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* Hickory wood chunks\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine seasonings and rub on pork ribs.\n#Refrigerate for at least 1 hour.\n#Place hickory chunks into a 350°F (175˚C) [[Cookbook:Smoker|smoker]] ''or'' a charcoal [[Cookbook:Grilling|grill]] set for indirect heat at 350°F.\n#Combine liquid ingredients and bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] over high heat until reduced by half.\n#Place ribs in smoker/grill and cook, [[Cookbook:Basting|basting]] often with maple syrup mixture, for 3–4 hours\n#[[Cookbook:Brush|Brush]] ribs with remaining mixture and place on a medium high grill until well browned.\n#Rest 15 minutes; serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using maple syrup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Barbecue recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Maple-Glazed BBQ Ribs","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 slab pork spareribs","sourceText":"1 slab pork spareribs","amountText":"1 slab pork spareribs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 Tbsp salt","sourceText":"1 Tbsp salt","amountText":"1 Tbsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 Tbsp dark brown sugar","sourceText":"3 Tbsp dark brown sugar","amountText":"3 Tbsp dark brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 Tbsp smoked paprika","sourceText":"2 Tbsp smoked paprika","amountText":"2 Tbsp smoked paprika","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"